Z||000001||Oreif||07-08-2000||12:20 AM||||Sounds like you need to set the Profile for here. Just open PIP and click on NEW (bottom of screen). make sure automatic is selected and type in the space "http://www.fiero.nl/fieroforum.pip"<BR>(without quotes)click on GET. Then it should work.<P><BR>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/LOGO3.jpg">    <P><p>[This message has been edited by Oreif (edited 07-08-2000).]||||reg||1
Z||000002||Cliff Pennock||07-08-2000||04:00 AM||||Sounds like you are running with an old version of Internet Explorer. PIP uses the Windows Internet libraries (wininet.dll) which are installed with Internet Explorer. Unfortunately, this is a file that can't be re-distributed by anyone other than Microsoft. Could you tell me which vesion of Internet Explorer you have?||||reg||1
